  "description": "Sends transactional email through several providers' free tiers as one sender. Each message goes to a provider with quota left, and a failure at one provider moves it to the next without sending it twice. Includes the Brevo, Resend, Mailjet, Mailgun, SMTP2GO, MailerSend and Elastic Email providers and AddFreeTierMail() for dependency injection.",
